t art\n🏆 Vote, get voted and be the #1 artist!\n\n❤️ Enjoying Draw the Brainrot 🎨? Leave a 👍 and ⭐ to show your support!\n\n⚠️ Inappropriate artwork is against TOS, and WILL result in a permanent ban.\n\nWe support all devices! 💻📱🎮","path":"/game/128038976143374-draw-your-brainrot","slug":"128038976143374-draw-your-brainrot","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1f4d84b31b6ba8e22563340c709a5f2d9d9ff1f3d4e3a371588f6d63acae98e7.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-12869bddae796d73804195d40d3f81de/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":37,"visitor":60754158,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-11T22:07:54.229Z","creator":{"name":"I make slop","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14724906937,"name":"[MASSIVE UPDATE + ORB INVASION] KSFU","desc":"Welcome to Killstreak Sword Fighting Universe. (KSFU)\n\nKill the NPC's on the kingdoms, gain your own aura and intensify your power!\nFight other players and steal their kills with your PVP abilities 🗡️\nReach the maximum phase of your sword to unlock other OP swords! 💥\n\nJoin our community server for further detailed updates 🔥\n\n\n\n\nIgnore:\n#aura #farm #aurafarm #streak #rivals #farming","path":"/game/14724906937-ksfu","slug":"14724906937-ksfu","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d73e037f84b4f8ad5df7d2f4e0ea261ef3f23fb5823848118f58abe4df3cd085.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-54b927614d6177de57a43eafe2d7d36f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":37,"visitor":5846390,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-29T18:30:57.631Z","creator":{"name":"KSFU","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7044096177,"name":"The Obby Elevator [Beta]","desc":"Welcome to The Obby Elevator! This is an Obby Race game where you can test your Obby skills and race with your friends! \nThere are currently 27 floors :)\n\n⭐Update⭐\n-3 New floors! (Floor 25, 26, 27)\n\nNew floors Coming Soon!\nJoin the group to Support! https://www.roblox.com/groups/7081575/Eagle-Studios#!/about\n\nIf you find any bugs/lag or have any suggestions, feel free to message johnpcps.\n\nThe Obby Elevator is currently in BETA version, where there may be lag and bugs in the game. Also, we will NOT take responsibility if your game data got wiped away.\n\nTags: Elevator, Obby, Toh, Tower of hell, Difficulty Chart Obby, Obby Elevator, Fun, Mega Fun Obby, The Normal Elevator","path":"/game/7044096177-the-obby-elevator","slug":"7044096177-the-obby-elevator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4e8535af75648e954d059d50ed830dea6c224c8c51809a8deb0e2f5ab81b8510.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-03e2fd74fcb8a5a7e5df5a418bc8516b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":37,"visitor":94354009,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-04T10:39:54.205Z","creator":{"name":"johnpcps","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":12240122896,"name":"FIGURE'S LIBRARY 📚","desc":"A game where you can practice the DOORS library without going through 50 rooms.\n\nAfter taking a random elevator, you find yourself locked inside a library with raw meat!\nThe lock requires a code to open. Find books scattered throughout the library and decipher the code with bpaper.\n\nThis game uses assets & ideas from DOORS by LSPLASH. All credit goes to the LSPLASH team.\nThis game is fan-made and not affiliated with LSPLASH.\n\n🥩📚 Liked the game? Join the Figure's Library group! https://www.roblox.com/communities/33741245","path":"/game/12240122896-figure-s-library","slug":"12240122896-figure-s-library","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a60b20fac913cb830ba0c5ab2f0eae15f01379be29e1df59677e6cfde6314f1c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ea573371915d59691b2fcfeb575a5d77/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":37,"visitor":40131467,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-30T19:41:39.382Z","creator":{"name":"vulture cat when","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9196514723,"name":"ChicBlocko","desc":"🏙️ Welcome To ChicBlocko!\n\nRun the streets. Grow an empire. Build your reputation.\n\nChicBlocko is an open world city located in Chicago where EVERY decision matters. Make money legally, take the fast money route, or balance both. Will you rise to power, or will you get left in the streets?\n\n📱 Equip your phone to find new Jobs, & Explore.\n\n💰ROBBERIES\n🚗BUY & FLEX LUXURY CARS\n💥EXPLODE CARS\n🎮CONSOLE SUPPORT\n🚨POLICE\n🏠HOMES & PENTHOUSES\n📦SAFE STORAGE\n♠️ARCADE\n🔫TRADE CUSTOM GUNS\nAND MORE❗\n\nYour choices define your outcome.\nWill you be the next in power.. Or get left behind?\n\n🔔 Join the group for updates, events & more.\n\nYou get menu access in PRIVATE SERVERS you OWN!","path":"/game/9196514723-chicblocko","slug":"9196514723-chicblocko","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/50ee2058cc51e0cbeaf1ffcbdc423023c759540f5cda364ce9de3738774f7c49.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b8a717aed6dc2446124e60f29595a145/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":37,"visitor":32364924,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-20T11:13:13.454Z","creator":{"name":"Blockos Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9903258006,"name":"Farmstead 🐔","desc":"Farmstead is a unique multiplayer farming experience. Start with a bare plot of land that you can develop into a fully operational farm with your friends!\n\nEverything grows offline in Farmstead!\n\n🌾 Farm a variety of crops, animals, and unique items.\n🏠 Decorate your farm with structures, decorations, gardens, and more!\n⛏️ Increase your capabilities with a variety of different skills.\n🍂 Unlock and explore new and unique regions.\n💎 Embark on quests to earn rewards.\n🎈 Invite your friends to farm and build together!\n\n🔔 Hit the FOLLOW button to get notifications for new updates! 🔔\n\nDeveloped by korky5000\nIn partnership with Firebrand Studios","path":"/game/9903258006-farmstead","slug":"9903258006-farmstead","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/589cc933d9535025c119f375912bdffb8c3d26efd17c4db63e4add70ebcf9ee5.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b5caa594e26b3a3c0c173ea29b6e2404/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":37,"visitor":40620468,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-09T10:09:12.432Z","creator":{"name":"Kanga Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":15511184827,"name":"[MALICOPE] Something Boss Fights","desc":"\"Two immortal beings going through a messy sibling argument until some random guy third-wheeled too hard and now everyone’s dead.” \n\nSomething Boss Fight is a not only a journey but also a life lesson to some. Welcome to an aspiring world where you are met not only with devastating loss but also tremendous ragebaits that probably wasnt even intended.\n\n<< DISCLAIMER: This game is difficult with little to no hand-holding, Practice is an essential aspect, so don't expect to win your way towards the end immediately. >>\n\n- KEYBINDS -\nQ - Roll (Iframe)\nR - Charm activation\nZ, X, C, V - Moveset\n\nYou can adjust your settings in the settings menu.\n\n- Credits\n• atomzz24 - Lead Developer / Scripter\n• yugiohgx70 - Model guy\n• EvilJacobthehero201 - Scripter, Animator\n• Avaloniselle - Scripter, VFX, Animator\n• CTGTheCreator - Scripter, UI designer\n• WindowsZnx - Loansharker\n\nOur so beloved Head Moderator \"exo4mexo\"  and our testers and staff team.\n\nInspired by Elden Ring and Skill Based Boss Fights","path":"/game/15511184827-something-boss-fights","slug":"15511184827-something-boss-fights","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f8b27836515400218127729cfaa72288abbfe84c8f0495725d7c88d09f0103e4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a88315f3aac94b56303040626a984bd9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":37,"visitor":19238603,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-20T03:01:20.076Z","creator":{"name":"The Radiant Lights","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}}],"totalGames":14203,"totalPages":592,"currentPage":189}